  "body": "Set on a 225sqm (approx.) freehold section with a generous 179sqm (approx.) floor area, this beautifully presented home delivers the perfect balance of space, comfort and easy-care living. Thoughtfully designed for modern families, it offers everything you need to simply move in, relax and enjoy.\r\n\r\nThe heart of the home is the light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, where family and friends can naturally come together. Whether you're preparing dinner while chatting with loved ones, enjoying a quiet morning coffee, or hosting weekend gatherings, this welcoming space is designed to make everyday moments feel special. A panel heater in the dining area and a heat pump in the main living area ensure year-round comfort, while a separate family lounge offers valuable flexibility - ideal as a media room, children's retreat or a peaceful space to unwind. A guest toilet and internal access single garage complete the lower level.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, four generous double bedrooms provide comfortable accommodation for the whole family. The master suite enjoys its own ensuite, walk-in wardrobe and heat pump, creating a relaxing retreat after a busy day. The remaining bedrooms are serviced by a well-appointed family bathroom featuring a full-size bathtub, ideal for children's evening bath time or a long, relaxing soak at the end of the day. Underfloor heating in both bathrooms adds a touch of everyday luxury and keeps those chilly winter mornings warm and comfortable.\r\n\r\nOutside, the fully fenced section provides a safe space for children and pets to play while remaining wonderfully low maintenance, allowing you to spend less time on upkeep and more time enjoying everything this fantastic location has to offer.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned in the heart of Silverdale, this home offers exceptional everyday convenience. Enjoy the ease of walking to the Silverdale Park & Ride for a stress-free commute, while Silverdale Mall, Pak'nSave, Highgate Business Park, cafés, restaurants, quality schools, childcare centres and medical facilities are all just minutes away. With quick motorway access also close by, everything you need for modern family living is within easy reach.\r\n\r\nOffering generous living, practical design and an unbeatable lifestyle location, this is a home you'll love coming back to every day.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your viewing-we'd love to show you through.",
